# The turns over a list of numbers are laid out once for each kind of storage; each layout leaves the store out and hands over on its own. Leaving at 0 stores nothing, leaving at 1, 8, 9, 20 stores
# what the turn in front stored (with the store made always the first line of each kind ends in 0; with none made the others end in 5).
# RUN(EVENT): compile StoresLeftOutOfTurnsLaidOut mechanisms=all
# EVENT: statistic StoresLeftOutOfTurnsLaidOut 2
# RUN(RIGHT): run-in-shell
# RIGHT: 0 0 0 5
# RIGHT-NEXT: 0 1 1 1
# RIGHT-NEXT: 0 8 36 36
# RIGHT-NEXT: 0 9 45 45
# RIGHT-NEXT: 0 20 210 210
# RIGHT-NEXT: 1 0 0 5
# RIGHT-NEXT: 1 1 0.5 0.5
# RIGHT-NEXT: 1 8 32 32
# RIGHT-NEXT: 1 9 40.5 40.5
# RIGHT-NEXT: 1 20 200 200
# RIGHT-NEXT: exited with 0
